[D Forever Warrior 1-30 (Braedyn)\\Loch Modan's group quests and the dam, the Dun Algaz pass and the Wetlands road, then Menethil Harbor: coast loops, the Greenwarden and the Third Fleet, ending with a hearth to Sentinel Hill.]
